  "readme": "# Register the source-reviewed P32 CG ADV_still_004\n\nThe published preview WebP already existed, but the main pictures/member catalog and package did not register ADV_still_004. This additive transaction copies the exact original1536x2048PNG and registers its existing same-dimension WebP. It writes only assets/pictures/ADV_still_004.png,assets/catalog.json,assets/package.json. The preview catalog and preview bytes remain exact; no transcode ran.\n\nA new independent image review directly compared the complete original PNG, complete WebP, existing contact sheet and14source frames005-018. The distinctive Felt/Mimi/hamburger interaction and background composition confirm the same artwork. Source evidence is2Hz overview with nominal timing uncertainty, not30fps entry or complete acting. Crop, wipe, phase, door, ending, motion, face and continuous playback remain unaccepted.\n\nRoot independently verified the exact three-file stage, every existing catalog value, exactly one added picture and two member mappings, all previous package records except the normal catalog self-index, the two new payload records, byte accounting, original-source bytes and reused WebP before installation. The unchanged additive asset installer exited0 and read every saved file back. An independent Node check confirmed the exact actual three-file write set, all283other formal scene/metadata guards and22protected files. No native scene or ownership/manifest file changed. Raw original PNG is present in the normal asset path; duplicated staged PNG/catalog/package bytes are not copied into this audit.\n\nPackage size increases by1,563,405B:1,404,098B original PNG,158,848B already-published WebP now indexed,459B catalog self-index growth. Existing source-project identity and every other registered resource remain. Existing WebP encode recipe is unrecovered; metadata does not pretend to re-encode it canonically.\n\nThis is resource registration only. The subsequent single character_image leaf for scene10470047/node74 must use a fresh normal field package after this registration commit/ACK. Unknown branch741 and all door/ending data remain intact. Full restoration is active.\n"
